label.description:
Label of the status, used to determine if the {@link MlModel} is active or not, and if it computes the
"primary" predictions, i.e. the predictions used by the end user of the application.

@see MlModel.Route.Status.Label#CHAMPION

versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

title:
Represents a point in the history of status for a given {@link MlModel.Route}.
The current status of a route is accessible through the field {@link MlModel.Route#status}.

@see MlModel.Route
